Subject: [PATCH 3/6] fix: journey plan card ends with PathFinder's WhatsApp /
 SMS check-in (4 rows)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

PathFinder's journey plan shows 4 steps, the last the weekly check-in; the
SkillLens plan card showed the shared plan-001's 3. With journey=demo the
card now adds the check-in as row 4, worded as PathFinder shows it
("Check-in · WhatsApp / SMS", "Weekly check-in on WhatsApp or SMS").
Without journey=demo the card is unchanged.

- lib/journey.ts: CHECK_IN wording; test in lib/journey.test.ts

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YcQNX4S5GbGG8rboP8226e
